WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:01.477
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.429 --> 00:00:03.594
Every cup tastes different!

3
00:00:03.594 --> 00:00:05.045
Too sour!

4
00:00:05.045 --> 00:00:06.474
Too sweet!

5
00:00:06.474 --> 00:00:09.615
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

6
00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:11.984
This is Episode 62.

7
00:00:11.984 --> 00:00:13.810
Meet the toy shelf.

8
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.917
Maya packs her best recipe in a lunchbox.

9
00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:18.232
Snap!

10
00:00:18.232 --> 00:00:19.796
Sealed tight.

11
00:00:19.796 --> 00:00:21.429
Onto the shelf.

12
00:00:21.429 --> 00:00:24.162
Every stand takes the same lunchbox.

13
00:00:24.162 --> 00:00:25.409
Sip.

14
00:00:25.409 --> 00:00:26.633
Yum!

15
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:27.881
Sip.

16
00:00:27.881 --> 00:00:29.105
Yum!

17
00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:31.293
Every cup tastes the same.

18
00:00:31.293 --> 00:00:32.779
New recipe?

19
00:00:32.779 --> 00:00:35.523
A new lunchbox, with a green ribbon.

20
00:00:35.523 --> 00:00:38.595
The old one stays too, just in case.

21
00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:41.078
A muddy blob reaches for a box.

22
00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:42.382
Clack!

23
00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:44.208
The shelf closes.

24
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:46.895
Only Cloud Town stands may take one.

25
00:00:46.895 --> 00:00:50.001
Same box, same taste, every stand.

26
00:00:50.001 --> 00:00:51.940
That is the toy shelf.

27
00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.253
Now you know Amazon ECR!

28
00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

